          "created_at": "2026-08-21T17:21:24.000Z",
          "cooked": "<p>Thank you for the simple repro. I am able to reproduce these artifacts which do seem like a bug.</p>\n<p>I’ve created an internal issue to track this. It appears to be coming from the scattering inside the volume (it doesn’t happen when DiffuseColor = 0 and becomes more pronounced with higher DiffuseColor values).</p>",
